    "body": "- Move the temporary audio decoding buffer from a local variable in `ac_iterate` to `ACSession` state. This eliminates repeated `malloc` and `free` calls in the audio processing hot path.\r\n- Enable Opus Discontinuous Transmission (DTX) to significantly reduce CPU usage and bandwidth consumption during periods of silence.\r\n- Explicitly set the Opus signal type to `OPUS_SIGNAL_VOICE` to allow the encoder to tune parameters specifically for speech.\r\n\r\n| Benchmark | Master (ns) | Audio-Opt (ns) | Speedup |\r\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSilentSequence/8000/1` | 347,193 | 159,331 | **2.18x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSilentSequence/48000/1` | 348,165 | 160,834 | **2.16x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSilentSequence/48000/2` | 680,299 | 346,678 | **1.96x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSequence/8000/1` | 633,584 | 309,632 | **2.05x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSequence/16000/1` | 1,027,035 | 515,050 | **1.99x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSequence/24000/1` | 930,737 | 423,444 | **2.20x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSequence/48000/1` | 953,682 | 428,802 | **2.22x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/EncodeSequence/48000/2` | 1,030,899 | 388,173 | **2.66x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/DecodeSequence/8000/1` | 15,910 | 15,963 | 1.00x |\r\n| `AudioBench/DecodeSequence/16000/1` | 25,427 | 25,339 | 1.00x |\r\n| `AudioBench/DecodeSequence/24000/1` | 36,569 | 33,725 | 1.08x |\r\n| `AudioBench/DecodeSequence/48000/1` | 43,214 | 39,954 | 1.08x |\r\n| `AudioBench/DecodeSequence/48000/2` | 76,726 | 103,070 | 0.74x |\r\n| `AudioBench/FullSequence/8000/1` | 617,308 | 327,911 | **1.88x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/FullSequence/16000/1` | 1,056,051 | 541,814 | **1.95x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/FullSequence/24000/1` | 977,370 | 470,718 | **2.08x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/FullSequence/48000/1` | 1,003,205 | 483,876 | **2.07x** |\r\n| `AudioBench/FullSequence/48000/2` | 1,121,644 | 488,985 | **2.29x** |\r\n\r\nTrade-off:\r\n\r\n- The decode buffer (~23KB) is now persistent for the lifetime of the session rather than being allocated on-demand. This increases the baseline memory footprint per call slightly but reduces heap fragmentation and allocator overhead.\r\n\r\n<!-- Reviewable:start -->\r\n- - -\r\nThis change is [<img src=\"https://reviewable.io/review_button.svg\" height=\"34\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"Reviewable\"/>](https://reviewable.io/reviews/TokTok/c-toxcore/2942)\r\n<!-- Reviewable:end -->\r\n",
